        "Title": "Revenge Of The Stir-Fry",
        "Location": "LOCATION_BANGKOK",
        "PublicId": "108361095206",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b120f9c4-0543-4458-b8e7-0b944098e066).Image",
        "Description": "Hello, Jedi.\r\rOur contract today comes from two individuals from Bangkok named Anakin Thaiwalker and Obi-Wan Ken Curry. They tell us that a organization in Thailand has recently been formed called Stir-Fry.\r\rThe Stir-Fry are part of the dark side, and they actively try to terrorize the Himmapan Hotel. The two leaders are employees, and three of the agents assume the alias of California girl tourists. You must eliminate these five (use the masamune as your lightsaber).\r\rMay the 4th be with you!",
